r in the palisades. \n\nThe fire department was not consulted on the draining of the palisades reservoir. \n\nThere were insufficient hydrants in the palisades..too far apart, and the incorrect diameter for sufficient water flow. \n\n“We could have saved more homes if we had more water”', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '11347122', 'name': 'Gavin Newsom', 'screen_name': 'GavinNewsom', 'indices': [103, 115]}, {'id_str': '44196397', 'name': 'Elon Musk', 'screen_name': 'elonmusk', 'indices': [139, 148]}]}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 5621, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Wed Jan 15 15:01:34 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1879544462289846711', 'display_text_range': [0, 279], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/RW5vNCO0m9', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/AveryWarwick/status/1879544462289846711/video/1', 'id_str': '1879541278276202496', 'indices': [280, 303], 'media_key': '13_1879541278276202496', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/1879541278276202496/img/xXChglugrjkJ8Fjc.jpg', 'type': 'video', 'url': 'https://t.co/RW5vNCO0m9', 'additional_media_info': {'monetizable': False}, 'ext_media_availability': {'status': 'Available'}, 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 1920, 'w': 1080, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'medium': {'h': 1200, 'w': 675, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'small': {'h': 680, 'w': 383, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'thumb': {'h': 150, 'w': 150, 'resize': 'crop'}}, 'original_info': {'height': 1920, 'width': 1080, 'focus_rects': []}, 'allow_download_status': {'allow_download': True}, 'video_info': {'aspect_ratio': [9, 16], 'duration_millis': 501182, 'variants': [{'content_type': 'application/x-mpegURL', 'url': 'https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1879541278276202496/pl/mwRC6wungQ7TpFPy.m3u8?tag=16&v=55a'}, {'bitrate': 632000, 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'url': 'https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1879541278276202496/vid/avc1/320x568/kd7BjdXqQW5bs9Pg.mp4?tag=16'}, {'bitrate': 9500